A temporary solution for openncode web users to switch to the old layout is to run this in the browser devtools console:

```
(() => {
  const key = "settings.v3";
  const settings = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key) || "{}");
  settings.general ??= {};
  settings.general.layoutTransitionEligible = true;
  settings.general.newLayoutDesigns = false;
  localStorage.setItem(key, JSON.stringify(settings));
  location.reload();
})();
```

> thanks [@dleopold](https://github.com/dleopold) for looking into it i use `opencode web` (and not the desktop app) so thats why i never see the toggle - very frustrating. i am stuck at v1.17 until this is fixed, because the new layout is not an option until it supports workspaces.

